          "text": "Nkabela bakajana akati kabantu ba-JabeziGileadi basimbi banakalindu bali myanda yone ibakatalina kuswaana abaalumi, elyo abo basimbi bakabasisya kuzilao ku-Silo munyika ya-Kanana.",
