                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akulindila, elyo na basimbi baku-Sile bazwa kukuzyana mumisobano, amuyubunuke mumyuunda akulijatila umwi aumwi mukaakwe akati kabasimbi ba-Sile, mwiinke abo kunyika ya-Benjamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino na bazyali babona bakulana babo basika kuzootutongaukila, tulabaambila kuti, Amubafwide luzyalo akubaleka bakwate, nkaambo twakabula kubayobweda umwi aumwi mwanakazi wakwe ciindi cankondo, alimwi teemwakabapa buyo pe, nkaambo nimwakacita obo nimwakaba amulandu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.20.48"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bab 20:48",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo ba-Benjamini bakacita obo, akulijatila banakazi babo, boonse buyo mbuli mweelwe wabo, akati kabasikuzyana mbubakatola. Elyo bakabweeda kucisi cabo, baakuyakulula minzi yabo akukala mulinjiyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu ba-Israyeli bakapambuka kuzwa oko kuciindi eco, bakaya umwi aumwi kumusyobo wakwe akuciinga cakwe. Bakaya boonse umwi aumwi kubusena bwakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.24"
            ]
          }
        }
